---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import NewsletterBand from "../components/NewsletterBand.astro";
---
<BaseLayout
  title="About The P List — Why We Celebrate Australia's Weirdest Homes"
  description="The P List is for Australian houses with the most personality and the worst listing photos. Avocado bathrooms, pebblecrete, carpet that has seen things."
  path="/about"
>
  <div class="wrap about-hero">
    <span class="eyebrow" data-reveal>About the list</span>
    <h1 data-reveal style="margin-top:14px;transition-delay:60ms">We champion the houses<br />everyone else scrolls past.</h1>
    <p data-reveal style="transition-delay:120ms">The P List is for the houses with the most personality and the worst listing photos. Avocado bathrooms. Pebblecrete. Carpet that has seen things.</p>
    <p data-reveal style="transition-delay:170ms"><strong>Properties that didn't make the A-list. But should have.</strong> That's the whole pitch.</p>

    <p data-reveal style="transition-delay:220ms">It started on <a href="https://www.instagram.com/christoradio" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="text-decoration:underline;">Instagram</a>. Christo kept scrolling realestate.com.au, kept stopping at houses that were clearly unwell, and started narrating them like a nature documentary. Then it got out of hand.</p>

    <p data-reveal style="transition-delay:250ms">Instagram gets the video. This site gets the rest: the full write-up, every photo, and a link to the real listing if you can still buy it.</p>

    <p data-reveal style="transition-delay:270ms">We are not real estate agents. Nobody here has a licence or wants one, and nobody gets a cent when your dream pebblecrete bungalow sells. We don't sell houses. We just tell you which ones to look at.</p>

    <p data-reveal style="transition-delay:300ms">Yes, it's sarcastic. But we only make fun of houses we love. If someone built a bar in the lounge room and painted every bedroom a different colour, they did it on purpose, and that deserves better than "scope to renovate." The one thing we can't stand is greige.</p>

    <p data-reveal style="transition-delay:330ms">Agents, if your listing ends up here, take it as a compliment. Your stock photos were never going to get this much attention on their own.</p>

    <a href="/" class="btn btn-solid" data-reveal style="transition-delay:360ms">Back to the list</a>
  </div>
  <NewsletterBand />
</BaseLayout>
